    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d303-a12">

                <pb facs="0367" n="1101" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1101"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 11 in No. 151.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rawicz to Mr. Peirce.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Warsaw</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-08"><hi rendition="#italic">October 8,
                        1895</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1539, M. C.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: On the 5th instant, evening, I received
                    your telegram: “Was Yablkowski’s passport viséed to enter Russia?” Immediately I
                    sent the answer: “Yablkowski’s particulars in my yesterday’s letter.” Yesterday
                    I received your telegram: “Letter received. Reply to question. Was passport
                    viséed?”</p>
                <p>Not being prepared to answer the question directly, I have forwarded this morning
                    a telegram to the judge at the city of Nieszawa, where Yablkowski is imprisoned,
                    of the following tenor: “Answer paid. Was Yablkowski’s passport viséed on the
                    frontier?”</p>
                <pb facs="0368" n="1102" xml:id="pg1102"/>
                <p>After receipt of the answer to the above dispatch, I shall wire it to you
                    immediately.</p>
                <p>Your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Joseph Rawicz</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Consul.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
